sequenceDiagram
    participant ODHOp as opendatahub-operator
    participant DSPO as DSPO
    participant Init as Init container<br/>odh-pipelines-components
    participant Vol as Shared volume<br/>/config/managed-pipelines
    participant KFP as KFP API server
    participant Task as Pipeline task pod<br/>odh-autorag / odh-automl / other
    participant S3 as S3 storage<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant HF as Hugging Face / OCI<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant MaaS as MaaS / LLM<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant VDB as Milvus / PGVector<br/>19530 / 5432 TCP
    participant MLflow as MLflow<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant K8s as Kubernetes API<br/>443/6443 TCP HTTPS
    participant MR as Model Registry<br/>configurable HTTP

    Note over ODHOp,KFP: Flow 1: Managed pipeline staging
    ODHOp->>DSPO: RELATED_IMAGE_* (env/params, imageParamMap)
    DSPO->>Init: Pod spec env (init container of KFP API server pod)
    alt any RELATED_IMAGE_* non-empty
        Init->>Init: Recompile managed pipelines with pinned images
    else no overrides
        Init->>Init: Use build-time compiled YAML
    end
    Init->>Vol: Copy managed-pipelines.json + {name}.yaml (filesystem)
    KFP->>Vol: Read manifest and pipeline YAML
    KFP->>Task: Execute component tasks (Argo)

    Note over Task,MLflow: Flow 2: AutoRAG optimization run
    Task->>S3: Read documents / write artifacts<br/>TLS, AWS access keys
    S3-->>Task: Objects
    Task->>MaaS: Generation / embeddings<br/>TLS (DSPA CA bundle), API key
    MaaS-->>Task: Completions / vectors
    Task->>VDB: Index / retrieve<br/>gRPC / PG, deployment-dependent TLS, credentials
    VDB-->>Task: Results
    Task->>MLflow: Log experiments<br/>TLS, Bearer MLFLOW_TRACKING_TOKEN

    Note over Task,MR: Flow 3: Fine-tune and deploy
    Task->>HF: Download dataset / model<br/>TLS, HF_TOKEN / AWS keys / pull secret
    HF-->>Task: Artifacts
    Task->>K8s: Submit Kubeflow Trainer job<br/>TLS (in-cluster CA), Bearer token
    K8s-->>Task: Job status
    Task->>K8s: Create/patch KServe InferenceService + ServingRuntime<br/>read HardwareProfile, TLS, Bearer token
    K8s-->>Task: Resource status
    Task->>MR: Register model<br/>plain HTTP, no encryption, no auth
    MR-->>Task: Registered model
